    User <-->|"prompt / response"| Bot
    Bot <-->|"POST activity (JWT) / reply"| APIM
    APIM <-->|"proxy /api/messages"| Tunnel
    Tunnel <--> Local
    Local <-->|"search token + query / ACL docs"| Search
    Local <--> Foundry

